als:<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987010/extras/2a8bab3159095dbadccd032d64518134.avif?t=1720409385\" width=600 height=336 /></span><br>Stir frying tea and brewing:<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987010/extras/f9b8223c82ecb6a50484720c2f8c3cc5.avif?t=1720409385\" width=600 height=336 /></span><br>Even crafting various weapons. Do your best to live.",
